# ⚠ public/ is NOT excluded, and must not be. It is 311 MB of videos, frame
# sequences and product imagery that Vite copies into dist verbatim, and the
# site renders blank hero sections without it. That is why this build context
# is large; it is the site, not waste.
#
# ⚠ Patterns match from the context root, not at every level — `**/` is what
# makes them apply at depth.

**/node_modules/
**/dist/
dist-ssr/

# The developer's local overrides. Left in, they would be inlined by Vite and
# silently beat the build args in docker-compose.yml — a production bundle
# pointing at http://localhost:8000.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.local

**/*.log
.vite/
**/.DS_Store
